# Atlas Core Component Design Tokens Specification
**Author:** Prism Van Dyk  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D146 13:25  
**Inputs used:** Git Access (Personal Access Token), Credentials (Git Hub Personal Access Token)  
## Summary

Comprehensive Design Token taxonomy and JSON schema for Atlas Core component styling, integrated via secure Git repositories using allocated access tokens.

## Deliverable
```
